      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  body {\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .policy-wrapper {\n    max-width: 960px;\n    margin: 40px auto;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n  }\n\n  .policy-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .policy-header h1 {\n    font-size: 32px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .policy-updated {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    opacity: 0.9;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .policy-divider {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #666;\n    margin: 24px 0;\n  }\n\n  .policy-card {\n    background: #222222;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 24px 24px 32px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .policy-card h2 {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .policy-card h3 {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .policy-card ul {\n    margin: 0 0 8px 18px;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .policy-card li {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"policy-wrapper\">\n  \n\n  <div class=\"policy-card\">\n<div class=\"policy-header\">\n    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>\n    <div class=\"policy-updated\">Last Updated: November 24, 2025</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"policy-divider\" />\n    <p><strong>BK Racing</strong></p>\n\n    <p>\n      Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how BK Racing (“we,” “us,” or “our”)\n      collects, uses, discloses, and protects your information when you visit our website\n      www.bkracing.com, www.bkracing.org, and www.bkracing.shop (the “Site”), make a purchase, or\n      otherwise interact with us online or offline.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>\n    <p>We collect information you provide directly to us and information collected automatically.</p>\n\n    <h3>A. Information You Provide to Us</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Personal details (name, email address, shipping/billing address, phone number)</li>\n      <li>Payment information (credit card numbers, PayPal details, etc. – processed securely via third-party payment processors)</li>\n      <li>Account information (username, password when you create an account)</li>\n      <li>Communications (customer service inquiries, reviews, messages)</li>\n      <li>Any other information you choose to provide</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>B. Information Collected Automatically</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Log data (IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, pages viewed, time spent on pages)</li>\n      <li>Cookies and similar technologies (see our Cookie Policy below)</li>\n      <li>Device information and location data (if you allow location services)</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n    <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Process and fulfill your orders (including shipping and customer support)</li>\n      <li>Communicate with you about orders, products, services, and promotional offers</li>\n      <li>Create and manage your online account</li>\n      <li>Improve our website, products, and services</li>\n      <li>Prevent fraud and enhance security</li>\n      <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>\n      <li>Send marketing communications (only with your consent where required by law)</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>3. Sharing Your Information</h2>\n    <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information with:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Third-party service providers (payment processors like Stripe/PayPal, shipping carriers like FedEx/UPS/DHL, email services like Klaviyo or Mailchimp, analytics providers like Google Analytics)</li>\n      <li>Law enforcement or government authorities when required by law</li>\n      <li>In the event of a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets (your information may be transferred to the new owner)</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>4. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</h2>\n    <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Remember your preferences and shopping cart</li>\n      <li>Analyze site traffic and user behavior</li>\n      <li>Deliver personalized advertising (including on third-party sites via remarketing)</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings. See our separate Cookie Policy for more details.</p>\n\n    <h2>5. Marketing &amp; Opt-Out</h2>\n    <p>You may receive marketing emails from us if you have opted in or made a purchase. You can unsubscribe at any time by:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Clicking “unsubscribe” in any marketing email</li>\n      <li>Updating your preferences in your account settings</li>\n      <li>Contacting us at the details below</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>6. Data Security</h2>\n    <p>\n      We use industry-standard security measures (SSL encryption, PCI-DSS compliant payment processing,\n      secure servers) to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the internet\n      is 100% secure.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>\n    <p>\n      Our Site may contain links to third-party websites (social media, sponsors, etc.). We are not\n      responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>8. Children’s Privacy</h2>\n    <p>\n      Our Site is not intended for children under 13 (or 16 in certain jurisdictions). We do not knowingly\n      collect personal information from children.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>9. International Data Transfers</h2>\n    <p>\n      If you are located outside the United States, your information may be transferred to and processed\n      in the United States or other countries where our service providers operate.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>10. Your Rights (GDPR, CCPA, etc.)</h2>\n    <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Access, correct, or delete your personal data</li>\n      <li>Object to or restrict processing</li>\n      <li>Data portability</li>\n      <li>Withdraw consent</li>\n      <li>Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at the details below.</p>\n\n    <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>\n    <p>\n      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of material changes by\n      posting the new policy on this page and updating the “Last Updated” date.\n    </p>\n\n    <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>\n    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact:</p>\n    <p>\n      BK Racing Inc.<br />\n      Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@bkracing.com\">support@bkracing.com</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
